<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 7.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 7.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flights in and out of St Petersburg airports may be delayed or postponed on October 8 and 9 due to strong winds, rain and low clouds, the Russian Weather Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>Airports at Arkhangelsk and Murmansk in northern Russia also may close because of strong winds and low clouds, the service said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
